      "text": "1. Fetch bucket\n2. Refill tokens\n3. Consume one token\n4. Update bucket atomically\n5. Return Allow/Reject\n\nex: {\n        Alice: 99 Request/ sec,\n        Charlie: 20 reuest/sec,\n        Bob: 9 request/ sec\n    }",
